  "post_title": "Onda, Suera y la comarca Espadán-Mijares votan en las primarias socialistas a la presidencia de la Generalitat",
  "post_date": "2014-03-09 13:09:15",
  "post_name": "onda-sura-y-la-comarca-espadan-mijares-votan-en-las-primarias-socialistas-a-la-presidencia-de-la-generalitat",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Noticias|Política",
  "post_content": "<p>Militantes y simpatizantes del PSPV-PSOE de Onda, con dos mesas, Suera, con una,&nbsp;y la comarca Espad&aacute;n-Mijares votan hasta las 20 horas en las primarias socialistas abierrtas a la presidencia de la Generalitat, entre Ximo Puig y Toni Gaspar.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/03/IMG_5150.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>En Onda hay dos mesas, una con un censo de 433 personas, donde votan las personas de este municipio, de Alcudia de Veo y de Tales. En la otra mesa ondense tienen derecho a voto 25 personas de Argelita, Fanzara, Ribesalbes y Vallat.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/03/IMG_5143.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>En la mesa de Suera pueden votar 48 personas de all&iacute; mismo, de Ay&oacute;dar&nbsp; y de Fuentes de Ay&oacute;dar.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primariespspvsueraondainici/img_5131.jpg\" alt=\"img_5131\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primariespspvsueraondainici/img_5132.jpg\" alt=\"img_5132\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primariespspvsueraondainici/img_5133.jpg\" alt=\"img_5133\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primariespspvsueraondainici/img_5134.jpg\" alt=\"img_5134\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primariespspvsueraondainici/img_5135.jpg\" alt=\"img_5135\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primariespspvsueraondainici/img_5136.jpg\" alt=\"img_5136\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primariespspvsueraondainici/img_5138.jpg\" alt=\"img_5138\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primariespspvsueraondainici/img_5140.jpg\" alt=\"img_5140\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primariespspvsueraondainici/img_5141.jpg\" alt=\"img_5141\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primariespspvsueraondainici/img_5143.jpg\" alt=\"img_5143\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primariespspvsueraondainici/img_5144.jpg\" alt=\"img_5144\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primariespspvsueraondainici/img_5145.jpg\" alt=\"img_5145\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primariespspvsueraondainici/img_5146.jpg\" alt=\"img_5146\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primariespspvsueraondainici/img_5147.jpg\" alt=\"img_5147\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primariespspvsueraondainici/img_5148.jpg\" alt=\"img_5148\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primariespspvsueraondainici/img_5149.jpg\" alt=\"img_5149\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primariespspvsueraondainici/img_5150.jpg\" alt=\"img_5150\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primariespspvsueraondainici/img_5151.jpg\" alt=\"img_5151\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4